    "claims": [
      "Each tank or silo is modelled as a bin; source lots keep their identity and cost",
      "Every movement draws a proportional share of each lot in the vessel",
      "Every tank movement saves an immutable version of the vessel's blend",
      "Traces forward from a source lot or backward from any movement",
      "Recall cases show where a lot is, output made from it, customers who got it and remaining stock",
      "Blocking a lot stops draws, consumption and transfers from any vessel holding it",
      "Records tank readings, cleanings and auditable reconciliation corrections",
      "Device API lets flow meters and scales post movements safely on retry",
      "Operator role center shows vessels, drift, held lots and open recalls",
      "Needs BC online, bins without directed put-away and pick, and lot-tracked items",
      "Licensed by user tiers billed monthly or annually; only app users need a license",
      "Plans start with a one-month free trial"
    ],
